{"about_the_game":"Tales of War is a highly dynamic multiplayer voxel medieval experience featuring large scale castle siege maps and many classes to choose from.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20+ classes</li></ul></strong> 5 classes of each role: Frontline, Ranged, Support and Mobile.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/classes.gif?t=1735602442\" /><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Siege [2-100 players]</li></ul></strong> Engage in large-scale battles and conquer all flags to win.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/siege.gif?t=1735602442\" /><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arena[1vs1 2vs2 3vs3]</li></ul></strong> Fight in close quarters and defeat each enemy 3 times to win. An Arena server contains 4 arenas (up to 24 players) and 12+ randomly selected map<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/arena.png?t=1735602442\" /><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Legends</li></ul></strong> Make a significant impact on the battlefield by selecting real life Legends with unique abilities.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/legends.gif?t=1735602442\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1270050?t=1735602442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1735602442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735602442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735602442","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description